(7685812, 1258421, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The people are perfectly placed in the light spot. I suggest to darken the building with the windows so it becomes a silhouette. It also needs a 0.71 degree rotation clockwise.</td>', 'Beautiful. The people are perfectly placed in the light spot. I suggest to darken the building with the windows so it becomes a silhouette. It also needs a 0.71 degree rotation clockwise.', '2021-02-01 13:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685814, 1258224, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. Strong gaze. Probably would be stronger even if she would be alone in the picture.</td>', 'Nice portrait. Strong gaze. Probably would be stronger even if she would be alone in the picture.', '2021-02-01 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685815, 1257826, 4008, '<td valign="top">What is it? A macro of a loudspeaker mesh or something similar? nice find. Nice clean as well and beautifully lit.</td>', 'What is it? A macro of a loudspeaker mesh or something similar? nice find. Nice clean as well and beautifully lit.', '2021-02-01 14:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685819, 1258263, 4008, '<td valign="top">An average cityscape to me. Not particularly interesting or beautiful.</td>', 'An average cityscape to me. Not particularly interesting or beautiful.', '2021-02-01 14:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685821, 1258550, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the colours and the dish, but the light is very flat and does not increase the appeal.</td>', 'I like the colours and the dish, but the light is very flat and does not increase the appeal.', '2021-02-01 14:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685822, 1258454, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird and good shot.</td>', 'Beautiful bird and good shot.', '2021-02-01 14:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685824, 1258541, 4008, '<td valign="top">The focus/sharpness is on the coat, not on the eyes.</td>', 'The focus/sharpness is on the coat, not on the eyes.', '2021-02-01 14:07:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685825, 1258549, 4008, '<td valign="top">I recognise the scene. The landscape is also beautiful in colour. The other picture was totally focussed in the landscape. With this standpoint the attention is more on the bike, but not only, it adds depth to the landscape as well. I think I like the perspective of the other more.</td>', 'I recognise the scene. The landscape is also beautiful in colour. The other picture was totally focussed in the landscape. With this standpoint the attention is more on the bike, but not only, it adds depth to the landscape as well. I think I like the perspective of the other more.', '2021-02-01 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685826, 1258573, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but it results is a rather messy scene. Not so interesting photographically to me.</td>', 'Nice capture but it results is a rather messy scene. Not so interesting photographically to me.', '2021-02-01 14:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685827, 1258191, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene, making good use of the strong shape. Not sure whether it needs the right 15% of the picture. Would it be better to crop away the part to the right of the pillar?</td>', 'Beautiful scene, making good use of the strong shape. Not sure whether it needs the right 15% of the picture. Would it be better to crop away the part to the right of the pillar?', '2021-02-01 14:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685833, 1258386, 4008, '<td valign="top">The title triggered a second look and then I saw the wounded paw. Maybe better to take a low standpoint the emphasise it photographically.</td>', 'The title triggered a second look and then I saw the wounded paw. Maybe better to take a low standpoint the emphasise it photographically.', '2021-02-01 14:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685835, 1258277, 4008, '<td valign="top">I wonder how you managed to get a light beam in what looks to be a clear night. Still some moist or dust in the air?</td>', 'I wonder how you managed to get a light beam in what looks to be a clear night. Still some moist or dust in the air?', '2021-02-01 14:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685840, 1258571, 4008, '<td valign="top">Just an average sunrise to me.</td>', 'Just an average sunrise to me.', '2021-02-01 14:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685841, 1258558, 4008, '<td valign="top">The light through the four windows makes this picture special. I like it.</td>', 'The light through the four windows makes this picture special. I like it.', '2021-02-01 14:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685843, 1258173, 4008, '<td valign="top">The picture has great depth to it with strong shadows. I would not expect that in snowy conditions but I like it.</td>', 'The picture has great depth to it with strong shadows. I would not expect that in snowy conditions but I like it.', '2021-02-01 14:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685845, 1258559, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice scene but the picture is so small it is hard to judge the quality.</td>', 'Nice scene but the picture is so small it is hard to judge the quality.', '2021-02-01 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685846, 1258504, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the scene. Maybe even better without the ship? Saturation seems to be a bit overdone.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the scene. Maybe even better without the ship? Saturation seems to be a bit overdone.', '2021-02-01 14:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685849, 1258547, 4008, '<td valign="top">The verticals needs to be straightened by a slight clockwise rotation.</td>', 'The verticals needs to be straightened by a slight clockwise rotation.', '2021-02-01 14:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685850, 1258312, 4008, '<td valign="top">Nice scene, well composed, but it needs a 0.76 degree counter clockwise rotation.</td>', 'Nice scene, well composed, but it needs a 0.76 degree counter clockwise rotation.', '2021-02-01 14:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685851, 1258384, 4008, '<td valign="top">The symmetry of the image is perfect. I like the viewpoint.</td>', 'The symmetry of the image is perfect. I like the viewpoint.', '2021-02-01 14:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685852, 1258522, 4008, '<td valign="top">A very cute dog portrait. The soft textures and the toning adds to that. I like it.</td>', 'A very cute dog portrait. The soft textures and the toning adds to that. I like it.', '2021-02-01 14:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685856, 1258370, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful birds and I like how you have captured two in one shot. The image is rather dark and underexposed overall. You could make it even more attractive by either adjusting exposure (if you have raw images) or by applying levels and curves correction. And if you want to improve it further you can dodge the reflection in the eye to make it brighter.</td>', 'Beautiful birds and I like how you have captured two in one shot. The image is rather dark and underexposed overall. You could make it even more attractive by either adjusting exposure (if you have raw images) or by applying levels and curves correction. And if you want to improve it further you can dodge the reflection in the eye to make it brighter.', '2021-02-01 15:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685887, 1258345, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful as ever. If I would be really nit-picking I would say it would be nice to have part of the second antenna in focus as well. I always wonder how you get so much in focus of a moving animal and whether you use natural or flash light. My macros always show a lot of out-of-focus, either because of DOF or because of movement. Top 3.</td>', 'Beautiful as ever. If I would be really nit-picking I would say it would be nice to have part of the second antenna in focus as well. I always wonder how you get so much in focus of a moving animal and whether you use natural or flash light. My macros always show a lot of out-of-focus, either because of DOF or because of movement. Top 3.', '2021-02-02 05:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685889, 1258457, 4008, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of the full wing. Great colours. The eye is not sharp but in this picture it does not matter so much to me since the emphasis is on the wing movement.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of the full wing. Great colours. The eye is not sharp but in this picture it does not matter so much to me since the emphasis is on the wing movement.', '2021-02-02 05:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685890, 1258323, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very nice natural portrait. You could increase the exposure a bit (or apply levels correction).</td>', 'Very nice natural portrait. You could increase the exposure a bit (or apply levels correction).', '2021-02-02 05:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685891, 1258525, 4008, '<td valign="top">The colours of the landscape, the depth of the landscape and the mist make this beautiful. I don''t like the strong sunset and the star effect.</td>', 'The colours of the landscape, the depth of the landscape and the mist make this beautiful. I don''t like the strong sunset and the star effect.', '2021-02-02 05:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685892, 1258545, 4008, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why it is a "winter" chili. I don''t know such a dish. Is it because of the snow in the background? Or because the food is served cold? The food looks cold as well.</td>', 'I don''t know why it is a "winter" chili. I don''t know such a dish. Is it because of the snow in the background? Or because the food is served cold? The food looks cold as well.', '2021-02-02 05:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685893, 1258505, 4008, '<td valign="top">I think it needs more work in terms of composition, viewing angle and especially lighting. It could be much more appetizing than this. With good light you could emphasise the texture of the bread, the colour of the wine, the shape of the apples, the shape of the glass etc. I would start with reduction of the number of elements, take a lower viewpoint and then experiment with different light sources. A single light source from the side to start with, and some reflectors to fill in shadows etc etc.</td>', 'I think it needs more work in terms of composition, viewing angle and especially lighting. It could be much more appetizing than this. With good light you could emphasise the texture of the bread, the colour of the wine, the shape of the apples, the shape of the glass etc. I would start with reduction of the number of elements, take a lower viewpoint and then experiment with different light sources. A single light source from the side to start with, and some reflectors to fill in shadows etc etc.', '2021-02-02 05:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685901, 1258438, 65234, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF and detail on this capture. The "oh, no!" expression on the fish face is great. Really, really well done image.</td>', 'Perfect DOF and detail on this capture. The "oh, no!" expression on the fish face is great. Really, really well done image.', '2021-02-02 10:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685902, 1258345, 65234, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous; nice DOF and all the green complements him nicely. The dewdrops are an added bonus point of interest.</td>', 'Gorgeous; nice DOF and all the green complements him nicely. The dewdrops are an added bonus point of interest.', '2021-02-02 10:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7685903, 1258563, 65234, '<td valign="top">Tough to isolate just one flake; nicely done.</td>', 'Tough to isolate just one flake; nicely done.', '2021-02-02 10:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
